[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0563","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0563.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0344","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 权限提升漏洞（Sechole 本地提权）","description":"Microsoft Windows NT 存在权限提升漏洞（Sechole），源于系统对调试权限的检查不当。本地普通用户可利用该漏洞获取系统关键进程（如 lsass.exe、csrss.exe）的调试级访问权限，进而注入代码或窃取令牌，将权限提升至 SYSTEM 级别。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 及早期版本，攻击者仅需本地普通用户权限即可发起利用，属于本地提权类漏洞，CVSS 评分 7.2（高危）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0344"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1998-08-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"安装微软安全公告 MS98-009 对应补丁，将 Windows NT 4.0 升级至 Service Pack 6 或更高版本，并限制普通用户的 SeDebugPrivilege 调试权限分配。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1998/ms98-009","http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb;en-us;Q190288"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0563.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0549","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0549.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0333","title":"HP OpenView Omniback 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"HP OpenView OmniBack 备份管理软件存在双重安全漏洞。远程攻击者可通过欺骗（Spoofing）手段绕过身份验证，以 root 权限在目标系统上远程执行任意命令；本地攻击者则可通过符号链接（Symlink）攻击获得 root 权限提升。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 系统上的 HP OpenView OmniBack 版本，CVSS v2 评分 7.5，危害等级高危，可在无需认证的条件下远程利用，导致机密性、完整性和可用性受损。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0333"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-08-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"1998-08-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议升级 HP-UX 至 11.00 或更高版本并安装 HP 安全补丁 PHSS_16425（HP-UX 10.20）或 PHSS_16426（HP-UX 11.00）。若暂无法升级，可临时禁用 rpc.ttdbserverd 服务或在防火墙层面封锁 RPC 端口（111/32771 等）作为临时缓解措施，并建议尽快应用 HP 官方安全补丁 PHSS_16425/PHSS_16426 彻底修复 rpc.ttdbserverd 缓冲区溢出漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b8581edcbd9fb1606112c43470d0a7cb92a751f8/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0333.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0333","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0333.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0fec8c5c64ee33c93da01ddd0b28bf8f9f743a61/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0333.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3f4ce19e2c9952be92df5da9390e93383644298b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f88m-wvmg-65x9/GHSA-f88m-wvmg-65x9.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0333.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x83000/82276/info.html","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/hpux_PHSS_16534.nasl","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000348.txt","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0549.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1350","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1350.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1136","title":"HP-UX与MPE/iX Predictive组件信息泄露漏洞","description":"HP-UX 11.0及更早版本与MPE/iX 5.5及更早版本中的Predictive组件存在信息泄露漏洞（CWE-200）。攻击者可通过电子邮件或调制解调器拦截客户与Response Center Predictive系统之间的消息数据传送，导致敏感配置信息和诊断数据被未授权获取。该漏洞源于Predictive消息在传输过程中缺乏加密和认证保护机制，攻击者无需认证即可利用本地访问方式实施拦截。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1136"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"1998-07-30T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"应用HP安全公告HPSBUX9807-081中提供的补丁，升级HP-UX到11.0以上版本或MPE/iX到5.5以上版本。在Predictive消息传输中启用加密和认证机制，限制对Response Center系统的网络访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://cert.ip-plus.net/bulletin-archive/msg00040.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221104526177&w=2","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/i-081.shtml","http://www.codetalker.com/advisories/vendor/hp/hpsbux9807-081.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1413"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1350.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1528","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1528.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1448","title":"Qualcomm Eudora 及 Eudora Light 邮件客户端远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Eudora 及 Eudora Light 3.05 之前版本在处理电子邮件日期字段时存在输入验证缺陷。远程攻击者可发送包含特定日期（如 1970 年之前的日期或当前日期 100 年后的日期）的恶意邮件，触发被零除错误或段错误，导致邮件客户端崩溃及用户邮箱数据损坏。利用条件简单，仅需构造特殊邮件发送给目标用户。该漏洞影响范围较广，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1448"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-07-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:27Z","remediation":"升级 Eudora 或 Eudora Light 至 3.05 及以上版本，该版本已修复日期解析导致的除零错误和段错误。如无法升级，建议在邮件服务器端过滤包含异常日期字段的邮件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221104526168&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cc228e85e595b2c95bda5544193864b06177c050/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1448.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1448","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1448.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9849013fb49e540f15cffd30644fcdcb875c1d4f/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1448.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/de3f834577328e71a123358d1db2b1637bc19e8a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6ppx-cq5m-vxwq/GHSA-6ppx-cq5m-vxwq.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87963/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1448.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-1999.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1528.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1498","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1498.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1406","title":"Red Hat Linux 5.1 dumpreg 本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 5.1 系统中的 dumpreg 工具以 O_RDWR（读写）权限打开 /dev/mem 设备文件，本地攻击者可通过将标准输出（fd 1）重定向到内核内存空间，导致系统崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 5.1 版本，需要本地用户权限才能利用，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1406"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-07-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:22Z","remediation":"立即移除 dumpreg 程序的 setuid 权限，执行 `chmod u-s /usr/sbin/dumpreg`（具体路径以系统实际位置为准），防止普通用户通过重定向标准输出写入 /dev/mem 造成内核崩溃。如条件允许，建议升级至 Red Hat Linux 6.0 或更新版本，该版本已修复此问题。此外可参照 OpenBSD 的 fdalloc 补丁思路，确保 setuid 程序的 0/1/2 号文件描述符默认指向 /dev/null，防止文件描述符劫持。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221104526185&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221104526192&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/372","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/36911ad057245f7d02822794db0f459d9b4c9b8f/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1406.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1406","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1406.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3012e5f1cf9bcfe839897275a956236aed334269/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1406.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d56576b8850027b4a8571fd52a8c5fe418f01987/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mjmw-j964-hfpm/GHSA-mjmw-j964-hfpm.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/372/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1406.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/Christopher0129/security-knowledge-base/blob/ecec748afe5bbe2fcd2fd04b00fb46bc827b2c5d/system-vulnerabilities/linux.md","https://github.com/andrewyang0620/Capstone-Fujitsu-1-Demo/blob/0c9014eacdeda2ea567d9f9ad3be0b262e292f1d/demo/backend/main.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1498.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1526","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1526.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1447","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 4.0 对象标签 CLASSID 参数远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 4.0 的 OBJECT 标签解析 CLASSID 参数时存在缓冲区边界缺陷，远程攻击者可通过构造包含超长 CLASSID 参数的 HTML 页面，诱使用户访问后触发缓冲区溢出，导致浏览器崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Internet Explorer 4.0 版本，攻击者无需身份认证，利用难度较低，但影响范围有限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1447"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-07-28T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:27Z","remediation":"建议升级到 Internet Explorer 5.0 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。由于 IE 4.0 已停止支持，建议迁移至现代浏览器（如 Edge/Chrome/Firefox）以获得持续安全更新。如无法升级，可在 IE 安全设置中将 ActiveX 控件和 OBJECT 相关选项禁用作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221104526169&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221104526188&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cc228e85e595b2c95bda5544193864b06177c050/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1447.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1447","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1447.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9849013fb49e540f15cffd30644fcdcb875c1d4f/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1447.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/de3f834577328e71a123358d1db2b1637bc19e8a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-45vh-w274-3hx8/GHSA-45vh-w274-3hx8.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1447.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000343.txt","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1526.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1526.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1526.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1233","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1233.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0941","title":"Mutt 邮件客户端 parse.c 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Mutt 邮件客户端 0.93i 及之前版本的 parse.c 文件中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当处理特制的 Content-Type 邮件头时，由于缺少边界检查，攻击者可通过发送包含恶意 shellcode 的邮件触发栈溢出，受害者在打开邮箱时无需查看邮件即可触发漏洞，导致远程代码执行。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0941"],"sources":["cve","bugtraq"],"published":"1998-07-28T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Mutt 至 0.93i 或更高版本，或应用官方提供的 parse.c 补丁，在 Content-Type 解析循环中添加边界检查条件 i < (SHORT_STRING - 1) 以防止缓冲区溢出。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221104526154&w=2"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1233.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1318","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1318.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1070","title":"Xylogics Annex 终端服务 ping CGI 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Xylogics Annex 终端服务的 ping CGI 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的超长查询参数（query parameter）触发该漏洞，导致目标服务崩溃并引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Xylogics Annex 终端服务相关版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。目前厂商已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1070"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-07-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:39Z","remediation":"Xylogics Annex 终端服务器（后被 Bay Networks 收购）已停产且不再受支持，建议立即将设备升级替换为仍在厂商支持周期内的终端服务器产品。若无法立即替换，可采取以下临时缓解措施：在边界防火墙上限制仅允许可信 IP 访问 Annex 管理接口和 CGI 服务（TCP 23/443 等端口）；在 Apache/Nginx 反向代理层对 ping CGI 的 query 参数长度做限制（不超过 256 字符），拦截超长请求；禁用不必要的 CGI 功能模块；监控并记录异常超长 URL 请求日志以便追溯攻击源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/10021"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1318.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1510","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1510.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1421","title":"NBase NH208 NH215 TFTP 服务器远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"NBase NH208 和 NH215 交换机运行的 TFTP 服务存在安全漏洞，由于固件更新文件使用默认文件名且未实施访问控制，远程攻击者可通过猜测目标文件名向交换机发送恶意固件更新，导致设备配置被篡改或引发崩溃从而造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 NBase NH208 和 NH215 交换机设备，CVSS 评分为 6.4，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1421"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-07-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:24Z","remediation":"建议立即禁用 NBase NH208/NH215 交换机上的 TFTP 服务，或通过访问控制列表限制仅允许受信管理 IP 访问 TFTP 端口 (69/UDP)。同时修改默认固件文件名，避免攻击者通过猜测文件名上传恶意固件。该设备已停止支持，建议升级到支持安全认证的现代交换机设备。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221104526016&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221104526065&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/212","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/48e2428aa9b9856f01006cca01971bc2ae076616/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1421.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1421","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1421.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/715601c34bbee046275188561ed6152c0e14bde6/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1421.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/664f1b641010bd1f3bc1d11a60ca29d1f4a0e4ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qg2h-h5g9-2m4x/GHSA-qg2h-h5g9-2m4x.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/account_super_debug.nasl","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/account_user_debug.nasl","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/account_super_forgot.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1421.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/212/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1510.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1507","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1507.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1420","title":"N-Base 交换机后门密码漏洞","description":"NBase 公司生产的 NH2012、NH2012R、NH2015 及 NH2048 系列交换机存在一个无法禁用的硬编码后门密码漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可利用该默认后门密码登录交换机管理界面，从而完全修改设备配置、更改网络策略或植入恶意规则。此漏洞影响范围广泛且利用难度极低，CVSS 评分高达 10.0，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1420"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-07-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:24Z","remediation":"建议立即将受影响 NBase 交换机替换为支持现代安全认证机制的设备，因 NBase 已停止运营且从未发布真正的修复补丁（仅更改了后门密码字符串），硬件替换是唯一彻底解决方案。若无法立即替换，须在网络边界防火墙配置 ACL 严格限制仅特定受信任管理 IP 地址可访问交换机的 telnet 管理端口（TCP 23），同时在交换机上使用 `set-ip` 命令将管理 IP 设为不可路由的私有地址段以禁用远程管理功能，并物理保护串口控制台防止本地接触。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221104526016&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221104526065&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/212","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/48e2428aa9b9856f01006cca01971bc2ae076616/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1420.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1420","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1420.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/715601c34bbee046275188561ed6152c0e14bde6/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1420.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/664f1b641010bd1f3bc1d11a60ca29d1f4a0e4ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5qxm-mmx9-f8h5/GHSA-5qxm-mmx9-f8h5.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/account_user_debug.nasl","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/account_user_forgot.nasl","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/account_super_debug.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_0_100.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/212/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1507.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1390","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1390.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1200","title":"Vintra SMTP MailServer EXPN 命令拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Vintra SMTP MailServer 在处理 EXPN 命令时存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者可通过向 SMTP 端口发送特制的 \"EXPN *@\" 命令，导致邮件服务器服务崩溃或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Vintra SMTP MailServer 相关版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。目前厂商已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1200"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-07-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:55Z","remediation":"编辑 Vintra SMTP MailServer 的 sendmail.cf 配置文件，添加配置行 `O PrivacyOptions=needmailhelo, noexpn` 以禁用 EXPN 命令，然后重启 MTA 服务。该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的邮件服务器（如 Exchange Server、Postfix）并从防火墙限制 25 端口仅允许可信 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=90222454131610&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1617","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e8d44fc9434dcaf08511a3267e0bf049a6756de/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1200.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1200","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1200.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f9199c6ea2112c9d2536a126688b640a45f0982a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1200.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r4fx-3jx4-5mcm/GHSA-r4fx-3jx4-5mcm.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88625/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1200.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/dd9f81e9fd85457bf78c55783cb6a31e9af71d63/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1390.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0022","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0022.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0005","title":"Netscape Messaging Server 与 UW IMAPD 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Netscape Messaging Server 3.55 及 University of Washington imapd 10.234 的 IMAP 服务存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 IMAP 服务的 authenticate 命令发送特制超长参数触发缓冲区溢出，进而以 IMAP 进程权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响大量使用相关 IMAP 软件的邮件服务器，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0005"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1998-07-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:18Z","remediation":"University of Washington imapd 10.234 用户应立即升级至 11.xx 及以上版本；Netscape Messaging Server 3.55 用户应升级至 4.0 或更新版本。建议在无法立即升级时，限制 IMAP 服务的源 IP 访问范围，或在不影响业务的情况下临时禁用 IMAP 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/177","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/130","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19107","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34851454a7b07498072de47d56f63daa4a4f524d/1999/CVE-1999-0005.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c8abbfc77cc703e2fd85623576b0f07a0c8427eb/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0005.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0005","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/24ebb1752fdaa57c8d421b21085e47d359e1300e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0005.json","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/1844.txt","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/imap.rules","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0005.md","https://github.com/FIRSTdotorg/Vuln4Cast/blob/c93910d268aa5b5d2260adb9b5d92094b2d06daf/YearlyVuln4Cast-V1.ipynb","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/uw_imap_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0022.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1553","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1553.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1558","title":"Digital OpenVMS loginout 未授权访问漏洞","description":"Digital OpenVMS 7.1 及更早版本中的 loginout 组件存在身份验证绕过漏洞。当启用外部认证机制时，loginout 未能正确验证用户身份，远程攻击者无需任何认证即可通过网络访问目标系统，获得未授权的登录权限，进而导致机密性、完整性和可用性受到部分损害。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，影响范围涵盖 OpenVMS 7.1 及之前版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1558"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-07-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:42Z","remediation":"立即安装 Digital Equipment Corporation (DEC) 提供的 OpenVMS V7.1-1H1 及以上 ECO 补丁包，或升级至 VSI OpenVMS 当前受支持版本。在无法打补丁时，临时缓解措施为在 SYSGEN 或 SYSMAN 中禁用外部认证（SET LOGINOUT/EXTERNAL_AUTHENTICATION=DISABLE），并在防火墙和路由器层面限制对 OpenVMS 登录服务的网络访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/i-071a.shtml","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7151.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/161","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e37edb84f090321c2ab4b4aefc57f84a75b1b940/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1558.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1558","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1558.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f73aeebc806b7ab5e9488498a056b9fa7bf30dd7/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1558.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c6mm-x7q6-44wf/GHSA-c6mm-x7q6-44wf.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1558.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--55ee91f1-4654-4add-8d7a-700d87a124e2.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--55ee91f1-4654-4add-8d7a-700d87a124e2.owl","https://github.com/cmjayasinghe/Threat-Intelligence-Dashboard/blob/ccfec8014cc85c9e776b8f657bdb7879139ab5ed/data/cves.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1553.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1362","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1362.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1149","title":"CSM Proxy 4.1 FTP 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"CSM Proxy 4.1 的 FTP 代理组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 FTP 端口发送超长字符串，触发缓冲区溢出，导致代理服务崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞源于对用户输入长度缺乏校验，攻击者无需认证即可利用，影响 CSM Proxy 4.1 版本，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1149"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-07-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:49Z","remediation":"建议升级至 CSM Proxy 4.1 之后的安全版本（如果厂商已发布修复版本）；由于 CSM 公司及产品早已停止维护，实际可行方案为：在防火墙层面限制对 FTP 端口（21）的访问，仅允许可信来源 IP 连接；如仍需使用该代理服务，建议迁移至正在维护的替代代理产品。临时缓解措施可通过配置 Windows 防火墙或网络 ACL 阻断外部来源对 TCP 21 端口的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221104525993&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1422","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/30c3a896d257362f7419b0c772be2f3dd063ccaa/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1149.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1149","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1149.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9b79b5eac5a874eeb91f0d9e37084feed8b830f5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1149.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rhwf-3wmm-xg4m/GHSA-rhwf-3wmm-xg4m.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88460/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1149.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000336.txt","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1362.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1270","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1270.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1432","title":"Sun Solaris 电源管理本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Solaris 操作系统电源管理功能存在安全漏洞。系统从挂起状态恢复时，在调用屏幕锁定程序 xlock 之前会短暂开放键盘输入，使得具有物理访问权限的攻击者可利用此时间窗口向最后一个活动应用程序输入命令，从而可能提升权限。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.4 至 2.6 版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1432"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-07-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:25Z","remediation":"升级到 Solaris 7 或更高版本，该版本在系统挂起前正确启动 xlock 进程。如无法升级，可禁用电源管理功能（执行 `/usr/bin/powerd -d` 关闭自动挂起），或使用第三方屏幕锁定工具（如 xlockmore）并配置在系统挂起前手动锁定会话。同时确保物理访问控制严格，防止未授权用户接触终端。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221104525997&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/160","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19126","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/48e2428aa9b9856f01006cca01971bc2ae076616/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1432.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1432","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1432.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/715601c34bbee046275188561ed6152c0e14bde6/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1432.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/de3f834577328e71a123358d1db2b1637bc19e8a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-prwq-fx78-ppf8/GHSA-prwq-fx78-ppf8.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000337.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--466b019b-2c41-4010-a86d-f6bedcdb2a44.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1432.json"],"poc_urls":[],"ex